OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AZelensky says he expects war to
OL,4,Acontinue into winter after talks with
OL,5,AUS envoys
OL,6,
OL,7,FWitkoff said he was "encouraged" by
OL,8,Fwhat he called "substantive" and
OL,9,Fimportant talks in Kyiv.
OL,11,FZelensky stressed that he wanted a just
OL,12,Fpeace with no opportunity for renewed
OL,13,Faggression by Russia.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
